# Repository root for the begonia-pciesim simulations.
#
# Each subdirectory (`rtl-sim/`, `qemu-sim/`) carries its own .gitignore for its
# own build output and downloads. This file covers only what belongs to the
# *checkout layout* rather than to either project: the two toolchain directories,
# which are siblings of the checkouts rather than of the repository.

# The self-contained toolchain that rtl-sim/setup-env.sh and qemu-sim/setup-env.sh
# build (~3 GB: conda environments, micromamba, package cache). It is deliberately
# a *sibling* of the checkouts, because that is where each env.sh looks for it by
# default:
#
#     rtl-sim/../.tools      ->  begonia-pciesim/.tools
#     qemu-sim/../.tools     ->  begonia-pciesim/.tools   (the same root)
#
# so it lands inside the repository even though it is not part of it. Rebuild it
# with `bash rtl-sim/setup-env.sh` or `bash qemu-sim/setup-env.sh`, or point a
# shared one at it with LITEPCIE_DEMO_TOOLS / QEMU_DEMO_TOOLS.
.tools/

# The QEMU source + build tree used by qemu-sim (several GB once built), also a
# sibling of its checkout for the same reason:
#
#     qemu-sim/../.qemu  ->  begonia-pciesim/.qemu
#
# Recreated by `make -C qemu-sim fetch` and `make -C qemu-sim build`.
.qemu/

# Editor / OS noise, in case someone works from the repository root.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
